# post-backup                                                                           #
#                                                                                       #
# Optional. Runs in the service directory after the service's backup: restart what      #
# pre-backup stopped, clean up. Make it executable (chmod +x post-backup).              #
#                                                                                       #
# It runs whenever pre-backup ran, even after a failed pre-backup, a failed backup or a #
# stop, so it can restart whatever pre-backup stopped. ARCHIVER_BACKUP_RESULT says how  #
# the backup went: success, failed, skipped or stopped. A non-zero exit is reported.    #
#                                                                                       #
# It receives the same variables as pre-backup, never storage credentials.              #
#########################################################################################

